# Paths excluded when Kosli fingerprints this directory - both when CI attests it
# (`kosli attest artifact deploy --artifact-type dir`) and when `kosli snapshot azure` unzips
# the deployed package and fingerprints its content the same way. Without this, the two
# fingerprints diverge: Azure/Kudu writes its own files into wwwroot (application logs, the
# default hostingstart.html-style landing page) that were never part of what CI built and
# attested.
logs/
*.log
*.html
